# shpmissions reads all credentials from the environment - never hardcode
# a token/key in source, a script, or a committed data file. Copy this to
# `.env` (already gitignored) and source it, or export the variables
# directly in your shell, before running anything that needs them.
#
# Currently NONE of this project's data sources require a credential:
#   - INS TEMPO-Online (population, unemployment, school enrollment, tourism)
#     - unauthenticated REST API.
#   - Eurostat (GDP per capita) - unauthenticated REST API.
#   - WorldPop - unauthenticated HTTPS download.
#   - OpenStreetMap / Geofabrik - unauthenticated HTTPS download.
#
# MotherDuck was tried once this session (for the Foursquare Open Source
# Places dataset) and abandoned in favor of the OSM/Geofabrik extraction
# pipeline - so it's not a live dependency, but the pattern is documented
# here in case that path is revisited:
#
# motherduck_token=
